# No captured traffic: the corpus is synthetic (GATES.md). Block accidental
# commits of real captures; verify_prose.py also FAILS if any is tracked. Tests
# write throwaway pcaps to pytest tmp dirs, outside the repo, so this is safe.
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.cap
